---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Physician-Guided Weight Loss
crumb: Weight Loss
permalink: /weight-loss/
eyebrow: Weight loss program
heading: Support built around you
lead: "No two people eat, live or struggle the same way. Your eating plan and your weekly coaching reflect that, with a physician guiding your care."
description: "Physician-guided weight loss at Glah Medical Group in Lancaster and Camp Hill, PA: a personal eating plan, weekly visits, food diary review, GLP-1 medication when right for you, and real patient results."
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-7 prose">
        <h2>A plan made of real food</h2>
        <p>Your plan is built around food you buy at your own grocery store. There are no packaged meals, shakes or supplements to buy from us. That way, the habits you learn keep working long after you reach your goal.</p>
        <h2>What we help with</h2>
        <ul class="check-list check-columns">
          <li>Nutrition education</li>
          <li>Help planning meals</li>
          <li>Food diary review</li>
          <li>Finding your overeating triggers</li>
          <li>Healthy recipes and exercise ideas</li>
          <li>Restaurants, parties and holidays</li>
        </ul>
        <h2>Medication, only if right for you</h2>
        <p>Some patients benefit from medicine to help with appetite. A physician decides whether one is appropriate for you. Medicine is never required to take part in the program.</p>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li><strong><a href="/weight-loss/glp-1/">GLP-1 medication</a></strong>, now offered, paired with your eating plan and regular check-ins</li>
          <li><strong>Short-term appetite suppressants</strong>, {{ pricing.weightLoss[2].price }} {{ pricing.weightLoss[2].unit }} if prescribed</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <aside class="values-card" aria-labelledby="weekly-heading">
          <h2 id="weekly-heading" class="h4">Why weekly visits?</h2>
          <p>Weekly visits are recommended for the best results. Each one is quick and keeps you accountable:</p>
          <ul class="check-list">
            <li>Weight and blood pressure check</li>
            <li>Food diary review and plan adjustments</li>
            <li>New nutrition reading and recipes each week</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mb-0"><a class="link-arrow" href="/pricing/">See pricing <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a></p>
        </aside>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 id="how-heading">From first call to keeping it off</h2>
    </div>
    <ol class="steps steps-grid">
      <li><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div><h3>Call or send a request</h3><p>Reach either office to schedule your first appointment.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div><h3>Initial consultation</h3><p>Weight, blood pressure and measurements, a look at how you eat now, and your personal plan.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div><h3>Weekly visits</h3><p>We review your food diary and fine-tune the plan as you go.</p></div></li>
      <li><span class="step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div><h3>Keep it off</h3><p>Habits, recipes and coping skills that last for life.</p></div></li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="results" aria-labelledby="results-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Real patient results</p>
      <h2 id="results-heading">Healthier numbers, fuller lives</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Two examples of what steady, supported change can look like.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <article class="case-card" aria-labelledby="case1">
          <div class="case-head">
            <div><h3 id="case1">Female patient, age 41</h3><p class="case-tag">5′5″ &middot; Goal: 160 lbs</p></div>
            <p class="case-drop">−48 lbs<span>206 → 158 lbs</span></p>
          </div>
          <table class="table case-table">
            <caption class="visually-hidden">Lab results before and after the program</caption>
            <thead><tr><th scope="col">Test</th><th scope="col">Before</th><th scope="col">After</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr><th scope="row">Triglycerides</th><td>414</td><td>103</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Cholesterol</th><td>204</td><td>180</td></tr>
              <tr><th scope="row">Glucose</th><td>96</td><td>85</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
          <ul class="wins list-unstyled"><li>Beat her goal weight</li><li>Triglycerides down 75%</li></ul>
        </article>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <article class="case-card" aria-labelledby="case2">
          <div class="case-head">
            <div><h3 id="case2">Male patient, age 74</h3><p class="case-tag">5′8″ &middot; Goal: fewer medicines, back to golf</p></div>
            <p class="case-drop">−72 lbs<span>249 → 177 lbs</span></p>
          </div>
          <p class="text-body-secondary">Over several months of weekly visits, his doctors were able to stop several of his medicines, and he got back on the golf course.</p>
          <ul class="wins list-unstyled"><li>Off diabetes medicine</li><li>Off blood pressure medicine</li><li>Off asthma medicine</li><li>Off angina medicine</li><li>Golfing again</li></ul>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="fine-print text-center mt-4 mb-0">Individual results vary. Only your prescribing physician should change your medicines.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-tint" id="tips" aria-labelledby="tips-heading">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Tips, support &amp; motivation</p>
      <h2 id="tips-heading">Small habits, big difference</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="row g-4">
      {%- set tips = [
        ["Hydration", "Drink 8 cups a day", "Spread water through the day, and skip artificial sweeteners and diet drinks."],
        ["Planning", "Prep on the weekend", "Plan your grocery list ahead and set aside weekend time to prep meals for the week."],
        ["Accountability", "Bring a buddy", "Invite a friend to walk or go to the gym, and use an app to track meals."],
        ["Mindset", "Choose, don't restrict", "Think of it as a healthier lifestyle built on positive choices. Feeling better is the best motivation."]
      ] %}
      {%- for t in tips %}
      <div class="col-sm-6 col-lg-3">
        <article class="tip-card tip-{{ loop.index }}">
          <p class="tip-kicker">{{ t[0] }}</p>
          <h3>{{ t[1] }}</h3>
          <p class="mb-0">{{ t[2] }}</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <div class="self-care mt-5">
      <h2 class="h3">Putting yourself first isn't selfish.</h2>
      <p class="mb-0">When we put ourselves last, the people we love miss out too. Eating well and staying active gives you more energy, more patience and more years with your family.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
